Revision: 3c28324314729dbade8287e868eef6338c42807a
Source: seccomp/default.json (Apache-2.0; see engine-seccomp.LICENSE)
Changes: appended unprivileged user-namespace clone rules and bubblewrap setup
syscalls (unshare, mount, umount2, pivot_root, sethostname). Default deny and
all upstream restrictions are retained. Run only with cap_drop: ALL and
no-new-privileges:true. Kernel user namespaces must be enabled; Python fails
closed when isolation cannot be established.
Canonical copy: falconpulsar-ai-engine/docker/engine-seccomp.json
Installer distribution copy: falconpulsar-installer/shared/engine-seccomp.json
